            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Various infective and non-infective conditions of the ear which arise from participation in Swimming are outlined. The etiology of these conditions is reviewed, the most appropriate treatment are discussed and preventative measures against incurrence or recurrence are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
